[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0259","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0259.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-33655","title":"New API 通知URL SSRF防护绕过漏洞","description":"New API（LLM 网关与 AI 资产管理系统）在通知 URL 处理中存在 SSRF 防护绕过漏洞。由于默认配置下 ApplyIPFilterForDomain 未启用，系统对 Webhook、Bark、Gotify 等通知 URL 进行域名校验时仅检查域名黑白名单，而未解析域名对应的 IP 地址并验证其是否属于内网或元数据地址。已认证的普通攻击者可利用此漏洞配置指向内部服务或云元数据接口的主机名，诱使服务器向内部网络发送请求，进而访问敏感信息或横向移动。该漏洞影响 0.12.0-alpha.1 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.7，危害等级高，建议升级至 0.12.0-alpha.1 或更高版本进行修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-33655","GHSA-6qcr-qxgr-m7fv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T23:17:04.763","updated":"2026-07-16T16:36:20.480","remediation":"立即升级到 v0.12.0-alpha.1 或更高版本，该版本已将 ApplyIPFilterForDomain 默认启用为 true，确保通知 URL 中的主机名被解析后经过 IP 过滤校验。如无法立即升级，在系统设置 → 请求设置中手动开启\"对域名启用 IP 过滤\"选项，同时配置通知 URL 域名白名单限制可用的外部域名，并在网络层面限制出站流量仅允许访问必要的外部服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/commit/20399d3c8fcb4e3649d53163eb11940fd6763743","https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/releases/tag/v0.12.0-alpha.1","https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/security/advisories/GHSA-6qcr-qxgr-m7fv","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/184a4cd474c4aaa5a27dac20b468f57966faa421/data/vuln/new-api/CVE-2026-33655.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2026/33xxx/CVE-2026-33655.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/4d1eebacb731643a646e28a4f60e64dd753a5ff4/proposals/euvd/CVE-2026-33655.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2167857fddab84dfe24129edd6c6319301254e21/2026/33xxx/CVE-2026-33655.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-09/TIER_3_CVE-2026-33655.md","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/234f830f64cdc68cb0704070f7453dab13cb7503/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-33655/README.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/CVE-2026-33655.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-33655.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-33655.md","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/62f018f20b9d742e5172b0bfe0117dd1e316969c/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-33655-new-api-ssrf-protection-bypass-via-unresolved-hostname-in-notification-urls.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0259.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0259.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0238","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0238.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-12590","title":"body-parser 无效limit值绕过请求体大小限制导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"body-parser 在处理请求体大小时存在安全缺陷，当应用程序配置了无效的 `limit` 参数值（如无法解析的字符串或 `NaN`）时，`bytes.parse()` 函数会返回 `null` 而非抛出错误，导致请求体大小限制被静默绕过。攻击者可利用此缺陷发送超大型请求体，耗尽服务器内存与 CPU 资源，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 body-parser 1.x 系列低于 1.20.6 及 2.x 系列低于 2.3.0 的版本。已在 1.20.6 和 2.3.0 版本中修复。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-12590","GHSA-v422-hmwv-36x6"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T11:16:24.670","updated":"2026-07-10T02:45:02.800","remediation":"升级 body-parser 至 1.20.6 或 2.3.0 及以上版本，这些版本会在传入无效 limit 值时抛出明确错误而非静默跳过校验。如无法升级，在传入 limit 值前进行校验，确保其可被正确解析为有效数字，拒绝 null 或非有限数值。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.openjsf.org/security-advisories.html","https://github.com/expressjs/body-parser/security/advisories/GHSA-v422-hmwv-36x6","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2026/12xxx/CVE-2026-12590.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-12590.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/body-parser/CVE-2026-12590.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-12590","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-12590.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/12xxx/CVE-2026-12590.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-12590.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-v422-hmwv-36x6/GHSA-v422-hmwv-36x6.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-12590.json","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/catalog/blob/2c3e722611b3943559eb16bcbf05371880a9d029/image/unleash/debian-13/8-dev.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0238.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0330","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0330.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49866","title":"libp2p @libp2p/gossipsub CPU拒绝服务漏洞","description":"libp2p的gossipsub模块在处理IHAVE和IWANT控制消息时存在未限制消息ID数量的缺陷。攻击者可向受影响的节点发送包含大量（约18万个）随机消息ID的4MB帧，导致节点同步迭代所有消息ID，阻塞Node.js事件循环约200毫秒。IHAVE变体需要约10个Sybil节点才能完全阻塞事件循环（阻塞时间超过心跳周期），而IWANT变体无速率限制，单个节点即可持续占用80%以上事件循环。该漏洞影响所有使用默认配置的@libp2p/gossipsub节点，包括以太坊共识客户端（如Lodestar）、启用pubsub的IPFS节点及任何调用createLibp2p并配置gossipsub服务的应用。攻击条件为节点接受入站连接且未自定义decodeRpcLimits参数。利用方式为连接目标节点并持续发送特制的超大IHAVE或IWANT控制消息。已在16.0.0版本中通过设置合理的解码限制修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49866","GHSA-cwc9-cp4j-mcvv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T21:16:49.137","updated":"2026-07-10T19:10:59.333","remediation":"升级 @libp2p/gossipsub 至 16.0.0 或更高版本，该版本将 maxIhaveMessageIDs 和 maxIwantMessageIDs 默认值从 Infinity 改为 5000，限制单帧迭代的消息 ID 数量。若暂时无法升级，可在创建 gossipsub 实例时显式配置 decodeRpcLimits 参数，将 maxIhaveMessageIDs 和 maxIwantMessageIDs 设置为有限值（如 5000）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/libp2p/js-libp2p/commit/773dd80ded24dbd6b19e675c89fd2f3b45f2d899","https://github.com/libp2p/js-libp2p/pull/3520","https://github.com/libp2p/js-libp2p/releases/tag/gossipsub-v16.0.0","https://github.com/libp2p/js-libp2p/security/advisories/GHSA-cwc9-cp4j-mcvv","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49866.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-49866.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49866.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/@libp2p/gossipsub/CVE-2026-49866.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-08/TIER_3_CVE-2026-49866.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-49866.md","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/62f018f20b9d742e5172b0bfe0117dd1e316969c/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-49866-libp2p-cpu-dos-via-oversized-ihave-and-iwant-control-message-arrays.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-49866.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-49866.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-cwc9-cp4j-mcvv/GHSA-cwc9-cp4j-mcvv.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0330.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0421","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0421.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53624","title":"GoFiber Fiber 中间件 HSTS 标头未设置漏洞","description":"GoFiber Fiber 框架的 helmet 中间件存在安全配置错误漏洞，由于 middleware/helmet/helmet.go 第67行错误地使用 c.Protocol() 替代 c.Scheme() 来判断 HTTPS 连接，导致 Strict-Transport-Security (HSTS) 响应头永远不会被设置。该漏洞影响所有使用 helmet 中间件并配置了 HSTSMaxAge > 0 的 GoFiber 应用，攻击者可通过中间人攻击将 HTTPS 连接降级为 HTTP，从而窃取敏感信息或会话 Cookie。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53624","GHSA-gv83-gqw6-9j2c"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T20:16:52.293","updated":"2026-07-15T20:49:42.063","remediation":"立即将 gofiber/fiber 升级到 v3.4.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 helmet 中间件中 c.Protocol() 与 c.Scheme() 混淆的问题。若无法立即升级，可临时在反向代理层（如 Nginx/Traefik）强制添加 Strict-Transport-Security 响应头作为缓解措施。修复方法：将 middleware/helmet/helmet.go 第 67 行的 c.Protocol() == \"https\" 替换为 c.Scheme() == \"https\"，确保 HSTS 头在 TLS 连接下正确设置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/commit/04dd4e7754f61768fddccacc79057e416f13e6bf","https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/4389","https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/releases/tag/v3.4.0","https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/security/advisories/GHSA-gv83-gqw6-9j2c","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53624.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/0873a8ca49043e1039aea3fb7f68d46c50a10ce2/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-53624.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/3b63910ae4e1e9b72167345f63d9f5750b50ec5a/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-53624","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c50b42f02438e6d2727eef5fecc301070143fae/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53624.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/61c26bb0fa513d67ff37c47a0aee18a8017dee2d/go/github.com/gofiber/fiber/CVE-2026-53624.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b2967c74374787d2c3ce14ea33111cd90ca3f359/content/posts/cve-2026-53624.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2026-5912.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-53624.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-gv83-gqw6-9j2c/GHSA-gv83-gqw6-9j2c.json","https://github.com/anchore/vulnerability-index-spec-files/blob/124f9dd88ae3210967065ab152ac9debdc2e3709/data/2026/46/ANCHORE-2026-46929.toml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0421.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0270","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0270.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44512","title":"ONNX 版本转换器上采样适配器空指针解引用漏洞","description":"ONNX（Open Neural Network Exchange）机器学习模型互操作框架的版本转换器适配器存在空指针解引用漏洞（CWE-476）。当 `convert_version()` 函数处理包含零输入（zero inputs）的 Upsample 算子的恶意模型时，`Upsample_6_7::adapt_upsample_6_7()` 在 `onnx/version_converter/adapters/upsample_6_7.h:31` 行直接访问 `node->inputs()[0]->sizes()` 而未检查输入数量，导致空指针解引用和程序崩溃（SIGSEGV），造成拒绝服务。攻击者可构造 107 字节的 PoC 模型文件触发该漏洞。该漏洞影响 ONNX 1.9.0 至 1.22.0 之前版本，1.22.0 版本已修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44512","GHSA-hwpq-hmq9-wj77"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T20:16:49.913","updated":"2026-07-13T17:02:01.533","remediation":"升级 ONNX 至 1.22.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Upsample 版本转换器适配器中未检查输入数量即访问 `node->inputs()[0]->sizes()` 导致的空指针解引用问题。如无法立即升级，可在调用 `convert_version()` 前对输入模型进行校验，确保 Upsample 节点输入数量大于 0，或使用沙箱环境隔离不可信模型的转换操作作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/onnx/onnx/commit/cd310408165ad47c3cd7eb2b86cb5b80aa2e4fdf","https://github.com/onnx/onnx/pull/7813","https://github.com/onnx/onnx/releases/tag/v1.22.0","https://github.com/onnx/onnx/security/advisories/GHSA-hwpq-hmq9-wj77","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-44512.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44512.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-44512.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/onnx/CVE-2026-44512.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/b3554c3c2bf0f2c12989d1d265a8595d25100129/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-44512","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3e6800281dab3089a8374b9fe419c8b8110ea36/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44512.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/57037e9ca1e585082424bbd15c12a674807d0c21/content/posts/cve-2026-44512.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-44512.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2026.txt","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/aad1d5d7fcfd4bf7bee792090d157de726946a96/vulns/onnx/PYSEC-2026-2689.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0270.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0001","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0001.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"mistune HTMLRenderer.safe_url() 百分号编码绕过导致跨站脚本漏洞","description":"mistune 是 Hsiaoming Yang 开发的 Python Markdown 解析库，其 HTML 渲染器中的 safe_url() 函数用于过滤危险协议（javascript:、data:、vbscript: 等）。该函数在检测协议前缀时未先对 URL 进行百分号解码，导致攻击者可以通过将协议名称中的字符进行百分号编码（如将 javascript: 编码为 javascript%3A）绕过安全过滤。当浏览器解析被绕过后的链接时，会自动解码百分号编码并执行恶意脚本，造成跨站脚本攻击（XSS）。攻击者无需身份认证，只需在评论系统、Wiki 等可提交 Markdown 内容的平台中提交含有恶意编码链接的内容，即可诱导用户点击后执行任意 JavaScript 代码，导致会话劫持、凭证窃取或帐户接管等严重后果。该漏洞影响 mistune 3.2.1 及之前的所有版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CNNVD-2026-10057356","GHSA-8ppg-4vv7-9p53","GHSA-jxhr-4j38-fpxg"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-08","updated":"2026-07-08","remediation":"升级 mistune 至 3.3.0 或更高版本。该版本已在 safe_url() 函数中对 URL 先执行 urllib.parse.unquote() 百分号解码再检查协议前缀，阻止编码绕过攻击。临时缓解措施：在应用层过滤用户提交的 Markdown 内容，检查并拦截包含 jav%61script、data%3A、vbscri%70t 等编码协议模式的链接；或在 WAF 中添加规则，对含有百分号编码的危险协议关键词的请求进行阻断。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-8ppg-4vv7-9p53","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-jxhr-4j38-fpxg"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0312","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0312.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49471","title":"Serena Web Dashboard DNS 重绑定远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Serena MCP 工具包内置的 Web 仪表板在固定端口（TCP 24282）上运行未经验证的 Flask API，缺乏认证、CSRF 保护和 Host 头校验。攻击者可通过 DNS 重绑定攻击，诱使用户在运行 Serena 时访问恶意网页，使浏览器将同源请求重定向至本地仪表板，进而向代理的持久化内存存储写入任意内容。结合默认启用的 `execute_shell_command`（`shell=True`）功能，代理在读取被污染的内存后会自动执行恶意命令，形成完整的远程代码执行链。该漏洞影响 v1.5.2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.3，危害等级高。官方已在 v1.5.2 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49471","GHSA-37h2-6p4f-mp3q"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-07T21:17:25.833","updated":"2026-07-20T14:54:40.713","remediation":"立即升级 Serena 至 v1.5.2 或更高版本，该版本在仪表板中增加了身份验证、CSRF 保护和 Host 头校验。如无法立即升级，可在 `config.yml` 中将 `web_dashboard` 设为 `false` 以禁用内置 Web 仪表板，或在防火墙中阻止对 TCP 端口 24282 的外部访问，并确保浏览器不访问运行 Serena 的本地地址。同时建议审查并移除所有默认 context 配置中 `shell=True` 的调用，改用 `shell=False` 并传递参数列表形式执行命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/oraios/serena/commit/016ccbe1c095a3eed7967737ac1d4df2754f5d96","https://github.com/oraios/serena/releases/tag/v1.5.2","https://github.com/oraios/serena/security/advisories/GHSA-37h2-6p4f-mp3q","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49471.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-49471.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/4d1eebacb731643a646e28a4f60e64dd753a5ff4/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-49471.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/serena-agent/CVE-2026-49471.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49471.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-07/TIER_3_CVE-2026-49471.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-49471.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/835070fbd6ecba04552e1532c7073330c40ea694/posts/cve-2026-49471-pip-serena-agent.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9119295a984ba3fccef08b7eec3fc9b62b1da974/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-37h2-6p4f-mp3q/GHSA-37h2-6p4f-mp3q.json","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/cba1106e73e57152f6afbb7764cd551d404f7b74/vulns/serena-agent/PYSEC-2026-3061.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0312.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0054","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0054.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-11405","title":"Tenda 多款路由器固件硬编码认证后门漏洞","description":"Tenda 多款路由器固件的 /bin/httpd 组件中存在硬编码认证后门漏洞。login() 函数在正常 MD5 密码验证失败后，会调用 GetValue(\"sys.rzadmin.password\") 从设备配置中读取预设后门密码，并与用户输入进行明文 strcmp() 比对，匹配即授予 role=2 管理员权限。该过程不校验用户名，任意用户名配合后门密码即可完成未授权登录。攻击者可通过 Web 管理界面直接利用此后门获取设备完全控制权，影响范围广泛，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-11405"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-06T20:16:29.450","updated":"2026-07-08T14:16:54.773","remediation":"厂商暂未发布修复固件，建议立即在路由器管理界面中关闭远程Web管理功能，并将管理端口仅绑定到内网；如业务允许，将受影响设备隔离至独立VLAN并限制管理IP白名单；密切关注Tenda官方下载页面（tendacn.com/download）获取更新；长期建议更换为有安全维护支持的路由器设备。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/912.html","https://kb.cert.org/vuls/id/213560","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/213560","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7f6823bc066973da81d3ae0684f0bccdfe7fa7a4/2026/CVE-2026-11405.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/0d273a0b2821f58c8dfa9e9b4a2ad049f300e8ec/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-11405.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9bf1bcd98df741ae892c1ba6b8127fb5da623fcc/cves/2026/11xxx/CVE-2026-11405.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/278bea3f9397da219bb29098ecf3912d7bfe0645/content/posts/cve-2026-11405.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/fc4c6dee3389f7c2d92f9f682d5634871f9f8639/references/CVE-2026-11405-2026-07-06-2005","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/664cbcfd536cb5b218ad44ed120fbb123053c091/cve/CVE-2026-11405.html","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/Tenda_%E5%A4%9A%E6%AC%BE%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1%E5%99%A8%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E7%A1%AC%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E5%90%8E%E9%97%A8%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-11405.toml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a249095ad9c03821a47129e86556f58c2c639b88/2026/11xxx/CVE-2026-11405.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a3495eb833b3f1f2096187c4b14884afc98b67a/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-w55r-jjxw-gxrx/GHSA-w55r-jjxw-gxrx.json","https://github.com/ekomsSavior/Jam_fi/blob/5c08af83f48920ff29bbe31d7af68e2214237e37/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/CVE-2026-11405","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-11405"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0054.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0054.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0054.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0127","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0127.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-9181","title":"Esri ArcGIS Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Esri ArcGIS Server 存在目录遍历漏洞（CVE-2026-9181，CVSS 9.8），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的路径参数触发路径遍历，导致覆盖系统敏感文件。成功利用此漏洞可获得 ArcGIS Server 的完全管理员权限，对机密性、完整性和可用性造成严重影响。该漏洞影响 Windows 和 Linux 平台上 ArcGIS Server 12.0 及之前所有版本，ArcGIS Enterprise on Kubernetes 不受影响。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-9181"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-06T19:17:09.553","updated":"2026-07-08T15:16:32.720","remediation":"立即升级 ArcGIS Server 至 12.0 之后的最新版本（Esri 已于 2026 年 5 月安全公告中发布修复版本）。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层添加路径规范化规则，拦截包含 `../` 等目录遍历特征的请求参数；同时考虑迁移至 ArcGIS Enterprise on Kubernetes 平台，该部署形态不受此漏洞影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.esri.com/arcgis-blog/products/arcgis-enterprise/administration/may-2026-arcgis-security-bulletin","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2026/9xxx/CVE-2026-9181.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_3_CVE-2026-9181.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d40439944a245bd3d15d0e2034784cb651a6b55/2026/9xxx/CVE-2026-9181.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/7f750702dd329dbecdbaa92edda4acff71648134/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-9181/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/644985d2f6944ebfc351d3a58af338c527c434cf/content/posts/cve-2026-9181.md","https://github.com/Gatos90/security-llm-wiki/blob/c8d27f1e6ab2ce6bff111d2104bb306d7ef1bcb5/advisories/cve/CVE-2026-9181.md","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/2853b83f9525211a3c7c25f2ab4e006505d500ad/archive/2026/2026-07-09.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Esri_ArcGIS_Server_%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86%E8%87%B4%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-9181.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-8h42-h5vq-h5gv/GHSA-8h42-h5vq-h5gv.json","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/57408b7c2bcf0fa671b0e4e3f1f5d07ab4ea9f8c/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-9181-esri-arcgis-server-contains-a-directory-traversal-vulnerability.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-9181"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0127.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0127.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0127.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0057","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0057.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13753","title":"HP Deskjet 2800 系列打印机未授权访问漏洞","description":"HP Deskjet 2800 系列打印机嵌入式 Web 服务存在授权缺失漏洞，未经验证的远程攻击者可通过网络访问向暴露的管理 API 端点发送 GET 请求，获取明文 Wi-Fi Direct 凭据、设备唯一标识信息及管理员安全状态配置等敏感数据。该漏洞影响固件版本低于或等于 TBP1CN2612AR 的设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。受影响的设置页面在正常 Web 界面访问时需管理员认证，但底层 API 端点缺乏权限校验导致信息泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13753"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-06T19:16:55.963","updated":"2026-07-06T20:16:29.737","remediation":"立即将 HP Deskjet 2800 系列打印机固件升级至高于 TBP1CN2612AR 的版本，可通过 HP 官方支持网站下载最新固件。如无法立即升级，请在网络防火墙或路由器上限制仅允许受信任的管理 IP 地址访问打印机 80/443 端口，并禁用打印机 Web 服务的远程访问功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://kb.cert.org/vuls/id/828543","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/828543","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9bf1bcd98df741ae892c1ba6b8127fb5da623fcc/cves/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13753.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_2_CVE-2026-13753.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/fa30538a41a7f2860cb7778b721229e52f8c6dd2/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13753.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/278bea3f9397da219bb29098ecf3912d7bfe0645/content/posts/cve-2026-13753.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-13753.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/fc4c6dee3389f7c2d92f9f682d5634871f9f8639/references/CVE-2026-13753-2026-07-06-1905","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/HP_Deskjet_2800_%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E6%9C%BA%E6%9C%AA%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-13753.toml","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/bb6223196139bc0688b84a1421e9ebaaf1270e61/2026/CVE-2026-13753.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/c627f818ca26f812f8f09efde01676a81d0688b8/references/contrib1-CVE-2026-13753-2026-07-06-1905","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/9c5d67a198e99294f34c44ceb3609166657a0a6c/CVEs_log/2026-07-07_zh.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-13753"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0057.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0064","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-24014","title":"Apache IoTDB DataNode 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Apache IoTDB DataNode 内部 RPC 接口在创建 Trigger 实例时，未对用户上传的 JAR 文件名进行充分校验，直接拼接路径导致路径遍历漏洞。若 DataNode 内部 RPC 端口暴露于不可信网络，攻击者可通过在 JAR 文件名中构造路径穿越序列（如 ../），将文件写入预期安装目录之外的位置，实现任意文件写入。该漏洞影响 Apache IoTDB 1.3.3 至 2.0.8 之前的版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害严重。官方建议升级至 2.0.8 版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-24014"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-06T09:16:35.270","updated":"2026-07-07T17:49:04.433","remediation":"立即升级 Apache IoTDB 至 2.0.8 及以上版本。同时确保 DataNode RPC 端口（默认 6667）不暴露于不可信网络，通过防火墙限制仅内网访问，并审计已有 Trigger JAR 文件完整性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://lists.apache.org/thread/38298f803gb5j9nlhf0l9zkf34o90h3m","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/07/06/12","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cb31df1745cb795b327f3818ad29a4b3cf1cd125/cves/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24014.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_2_CVE-2026-24014.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a72c2d0c49169a0d402485a1b08b9cdd8f9a4630/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24014.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-24014.md","https://github.com/apache/security-site/blob/688b49dd77e12d8bea3c3d690f69122f8f07c16a/static/projects/iotdb/CVE-2026-24014.osv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-24014.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/Apache_IoTDB_%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86_CVE-2026-24014.toml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/4d9fb75e7ff5bbebd0a7f4ae8a906875efb03f1c/references/contrib1-CVE-2026-24014-2026-07-06-2005","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/9c6f35acd5a41ddddf44506d341fe005458d02b2/vulns/apache-iotdb/PYSEC-2026-2081.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-24014.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-24014"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0063","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-24013","title":"Apache IoTDB Thrift RPC 身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"Apache IoTDB 的 Thrift RPC 查询处理器对 sessionId 参数缺乏严格校验，未经认证的远程攻击者可通过构造带有伪造 sessionId 的请求绕过 openSession 身份认证，直接获取合法的时序数据查询结果，导致未授权读取敏感数据。该漏洞影响 Apache IoTDB 1.3.3 至 2.0.8 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重。建议升级至 2.0.8 版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-24013"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-06T09:16:35.163","updated":"2026-07-07T17:50:26.877","remediation":"立即升级 Apache IoTDB 至 2.0.8 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Thrift RPC 会话 ID 校验缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在网络层面限制对 IoTDB Thrift RPC 端口的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并启用会话认证日志进行监控。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://lists.apache.org/thread/6pwkgnqhbm56mvn309f87snm84s0b75y","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/07/06/11","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cb31df1745cb795b327f3818ad29a4b3cf1cd125/cves/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24013.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_2_CVE-2026-24013.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a72c2d0c49169a0d402485a1b08b9cdd8f9a4630/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24013.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-24013.md","https://github.com/apache/security-site/blob/688b49dd77e12d8bea3c3d690f69122f8f07c16a/static/projects/iotdb/CVE-2026-24013.osv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-24013.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/Apache_IoTDB_%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-24013.toml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/4d9fb75e7ff5bbebd0a7f4ae8a906875efb03f1c/references/contrib1-CVE-2026-24013-2026-07-06-2005","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/9c6f35acd5a41ddddf44506d341fe005458d02b2/vulns/apache-iotdb/PYSEC-2026-2080.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-24013.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-24013"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0063.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0062","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0062.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-24012","title":"Apache IoTDB 极端时间范围查询致堆耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache IoTDB 的 DataNode 接口未对查询的时间范围和聚合间隔施加合理限制，远程攻击者可通过构造极端参数（如超大时间跨度搭配最小聚合间隔）的查询请求，迫使 DataNode 在内存中构建过大的结果集，导致 Java 堆内存耗尽、进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Apache IoTDB 1.3.3 至 2.0.8 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 2.0.8 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-24012"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-06T09:16:35.037","updated":"2026-07-07T17:53:36.780","remediation":"升级到 Apache IoTDB 2.0.8 及以上版本，该版本已对查询时间范围和聚合间隔施加合理限制，防止堆内存耗尽。临时缓解措施：在网关或反向代理层限制对 DataNode 的查询接口访问，并配置 JVM 堆内存上限（-Xmx）以控制单次查询最大内存消耗。建议同时监控查询请求中的时间范围参数，拒绝超过阈值（如时间跨度超过 30 天且聚合间隔小于 1 秒）的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://lists.apache.org/thread/0g5th1t2vj6j8hm5t9w3xh9n6f6ht9z8","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/07/06/10","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cb31df1745cb795b327f3818ad29a4b3cf1cd125/cves/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24012.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_3_CVE-2026-24012.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/fa30538a41a7f2860cb7778b721229e52f8c6dd2/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24012.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-24012.md","https://github.com/apache/security-site/blob/688b49dd77e12d8bea3c3d690f69122f8f07c16a/static/projects/iotdb/CVE-2026-24012.osv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-24012.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/fc4c6dee3389f7c2d92f9f682d5634871f9f8639/references/CVE-2026-24012-2026-07-06-2005","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/Apache_IoTDB_%E6%9E%81%E7%AB%AF%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E8%87%B4%E5%A0%86%E8%80%97%E5%B0%BD%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-24012.toml","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/9c6f35acd5a41ddddf44506d341fe005458d02b2/vulns/apache-iotdb/PYSEC-2026-2079.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be827cc2d99405b0a015aad2694b62cec4eb4f9e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-24012.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-24012"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0062.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0272","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0272.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45016","title":"EGroupware Mail 组件文件包含漏洞","description":"EGroupware 邮件 HTML 编辑功能在处理内嵌图片 URL 时，未对 URI scheme 进行充分校验，仅通过 str_starts_with($myUrl, 'http') 判断是否为 HTTP 链接，导致 file:// 协议被绕过检测。攻击者可构造包含 file:// 协议的恶意邮件，利用 file_get_contents() 读取服务器任意本地文件（如 /etc/passwd）并以内联 MIME 附件形式嵌入外发邮件中。该漏洞影响 EGroupware 全版本，攻击者需具备向目标系统发送 HTML 邮件的权限，属于低权限条件下的高危信息泄露漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45016","GHSA-c8m7-r2jv-rw63"],"sources":["cve","ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-06","updated":"2026-07-07","remediation":"升级 EGroupware 到 26.5.20260507（26.x 分支）或 23.1.20260601（23.x 分支）及以上版本。如无法立即升级，修改 api/src/Mail.php 中 processURL2InlineImages 函数，将 URI 校验由 !str_starts_with($myUrl, 'http') 替换为 if (!preg_match('#^https?://#i', $myUrl)) { continue; }，禁止 file:// 等非 HTTP 协议 URIs 传入 file_get_contents。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/EGroupware/egroupware/security/advisories/GHSA-c8m7-r2jv-rw63","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-c8m7-r2jv-rw63"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0272.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0004","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0004.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"CNNVD 收录漏洞 CNNVD-2026-10183878 安全风险","description":"TRENDnet TEW-432BRP 路由器固件 3.10B20 版本中的 boa Web 服务在处理 /goform/formWlanSetup 接口时，未对 enrollee 参数长度进行校验，直接将用户输入数据拷贝到栈上局部变量，导致栈缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可通过发送特制 HTTP POST 请求触发漏洞，覆盖函数返回地址，实现远程代码执行或导致设备崩溃。该产品已于 2009 年停产（EOL），厂商不提供修复补丁，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CNNVD-2026-10183878"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-06","updated":"2026-07-06","remediation":"无法获取该漏洞的详细信息，包括受影响厂商、产品及漏洞类型，因此无法给出具体的修复建议。建议通过 CNNVD 官方渠道 (www.cnnvd.org.cn) 查询该编号的完整漏洞详情后，再针对性制定修复方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0004.toml"}]